## 14. Scope Restrictions

Do not implement yet:

- Playwright browser execution.
- Autonomous browser exploration.
- Screenshot capture during execution.
- Self-healing selectors.
- CI/CD integration.
- RAG or vector databases.

These belong to future milestones.

## 15. Completion Criteria

This milestone is complete only when:

1. An approved URS can be selected.
2. A structured test plan can be generated.
3. Relevant test cases are generated for approved requirements.
4. UI mockup information contributes to relevant UI and visual test cases.
5. Every test case has valid requirement traceability.
6. Coverage is calculated correctly.
7. Duplicates and invalid test cases are detected.
8. Users can review, edit, approve and reject test cases.
9. Test suites can be retrieved and exported.
10. Existing functionality continues working.
11. Relevant automated tests pass.

At completion, provide:
- Architecture changes.
- Files created and modified.
- New APIs.
- Database changes.
- AI configuration.
- Test results.
- Known limitations.
- Remaining work for the next milestone.

Do not claim any functionality is complete unless it has actually been implemented and tested.
